{"id":"a08f2f109051a659","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Card7 Mahlo Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal — ZFC Card7 Mahlo Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal — ZFC Card7 Mahlo Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-mahlo]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal — ZFC Card7 Mahlo Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"552b26d6fef18e07\" href=\"?note=552b26d6fef18e07\" title=\"58-df-mahlo\">58-df-mahlo</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the canonical predicate requiring strong inaccessibility and stationarily many regular cardinals (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"552b26d6fef18e07\" href=\"?note=552b26d6fef18e07\" title=\"58-df-mahlo\">58-df-mahlo</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This numbered name is an exact alias of the canonical Mahlo predicate.  The former definition captured only the weak-Mahlo stationarity condition and omitted strong inaccessibility.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-mahlo","status":"resolved","id":"552b26d6fef18e07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mahlo]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mahlo","status":"resolved","id":"552b26d6fef18e07","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)$ is the canonical predicate requiring strong inaccessibility and stationarily many regular cardinals (see [[58-df-mahlo]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}mahlo\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard7MahloCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mahlo}(\\kappa).","display":true}],"bytes":959,"backlinks":[{"id":"49f5b26bf6927c66","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-card7-mahlo-cardinal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["552b26d6fef18e07"]}